
Not all SkyLake processors can handle AVX and FMA

Therefore this will fail with SIGILL

CFLAGS= -std=iso9899:2011 -m64 -O3 -ffast-math 
          -ffp-contract=on -march=k8 -mtune=k8
          -mfma -mno-avx -mno-avx2


Seems that all manner of flags will give me data that
does not match another x86 machine with a Xeon

